Package: kairoECS
Title: Event-Component Simulation Bindings
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("KairoECS", "Maintainers", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainers@example.com"))
Description: R bindings for the KairoECS Rust simulation engine, currently
    exposing a deterministic scheduler and event-log facade while native FFI is
    intentionally not configured.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Type: Package
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Suggests: arrow, devtools, lintr, pkgdown, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
